  m_BlockDisplayName: Hawkeye Armoured Panel Piston
  m_BlockDescription: 'Another set of enforced interlocked plates composing a piston
    that can extend to 4 blocks from its relatively less compressed state of 2. Works
    pretty well as armor. Armour? What region is this?

    Right click to configure this block.


    This is a BlockMover. Blocks attached to the head of this will have their own
    physics separate from the body they are on, yet still restrained to the same tech.
    Like a multi-tech, but a single tech. ClusterTech.'
